---
description: General project conventions
alwaysApply: true
---

- TypeScript strict mode. No `any` unless a comment explains why.
- Follow AGENTS.md. Use the `sc` CLI instead of doing its job by hand.
- Prefer small, focused changes. Do not reformat unrelated code.
- Use `import type` for type-only imports.
- Before finishing, run `npm run sc:validate` and fix what it reports.
